.* root directory of this project.
.*
.* The media displays: WRKIMGCLG (the catalogs, F11 their texts),
.* WRKIMGCLGE (one catalog's entries), WRKTAPCTG (a media library's
.* cartridges) and WRKMLBSTS (the libraries and their drives), DSPTAP
.* (a file's labels, the volume label alone, a save's objects and
.* header, a file that is not a save), DSPTAPCTG, DSPOPT (four views)
.* and WRKOPTVOL. The WRKIMGCLG geometry follows
.* golden/phase11/displays/wrkimgclg.txt, WRKOPTVOL pub400's
.* golden/audit/displays/wrkoptvol.txt; WRKIMGCLGE, WRKMLBSTS and the
.* DSPTAP displays the 7.1 oracle's (wrkimgclge71, wrkmlbsts71,
.* dsptap71-*). No oracle has a library or optical volume, so the
.* others follow IBM's documentation.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
