:HELP NAME='FLD/RSRCJOB'.Job         name
:P.The job name of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKMLBSTS/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.1=Vary on
:PD.Type 1 next to an entry and press Enter to vary on it. The Vary
Configuration (VRYCFG) command runs for the entry.
:PT.2=Vary off
:PD.Type 2 next to an entry and press Enter to vary off it. The Vary
Configuration (VRYCFG) command runs for the entry.
:PT.3=Reset resource
:PD.Type 3 next to an entry and press Enter to reset resource it.
:PT.4=Allocate resource
:PD.Type 4 next to an entry and press Enter to allocate resource it.
:PT.5=Allocate unprotected
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to allocate unprotected it.
:PT.6=Deallocate resource
:PD.Type 6 next to an entry and press Enter to deallocate resource it.
:PT.8=Work with description
:PD.Type 8 next to an entry and press Enter to work with description it.
The Work with Device Descriptions (WRKDEVD) command runs for the entry.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
